## Set up the agent loop

From this project checkout, ask Codex to guide the agent loop. The loop is
recoverable and serial. It uses GitLab.

```text
Set up and manage the recoverable serial GitLab agent loop for this project.
Follow this repository's instructions and the linked loop setup guide. Check
the prerequisites and safeguards, and surface any human decisions or blockers.
```

The [agent-loop setup guide](docs/how-to/setup-serial-gitlab-agent-loop.md) is
the source of truth. It covers setup and use. See the
[agent-loop reference](docs/reference/serial-gitlab-agent-loop.md) for the
model.

